WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.219
[MUSIC]

00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:08.492
This is not a normal year, we've been
looking at each other on screen and

00:00:08.492 --> 00:00:11.740
occasionally from a distance
of six feet or more.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.160
As you know, Stanford is a special place,
the beauty of the campus,

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.260
the ability to learn
from brilliant faculty,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.790
the culture of collaboration and
optimism, and most of all the people.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:27.230
During your time at the GSB you've gone
from being a set of individuals to being

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:32.400
a class that's held together by bonds that
even social distancing cannot diminish.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.590
The pandemic is shown how much
the world needs leaders for

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.540
society, who make decisions
based on data and reason,

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:44.830
who act boldly to demonstrate
compassion and inspire others.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:49.127
You are those leaders, we are counting
on you to bring your ideas,

00:00:49.127 --> 00:00:53.992
your experience, and your passion to
whatever you do and wherever you go.

00:00:53.992 --> 00:00:57.523
[MUSIC]

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:04.291
&gt;&gt; Congratulations to the Stanford
Graduate School of Business Class of 2020.

00:01:04.291 --> 00:01:12.210
I am so proud of all of you,
what you have accomplished is remarkable.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:17.566
You have put yourselves on a journey
towards making a big impact in the world.

00:01:17.566 --> 00:01:24.730
Simply put, you are the absolute
best of our future leaders.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.830
Now, I know this is not exactly
the graduation you were all expecting.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:37.310
At the same time, today's adversity
makes your class a truly historical.

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:44.028
And for now, congratulations on
your incredible achievement and

00:01:44.028 --> 00:01:46.895
welcome to the GSB alumni family.

00:01:46.895 --> 00:01:56.895
[MUSIC]

